// Title: Suspicious Reconnaissance Activity Using Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// ID: c8a180d6-47a3-4345-a609-53f9c3d834fc
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-10-10
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1087.001
// Description: Detects suspicious reconnaissance command line activity on Windows systems using the PowerShell Get-LocalGroupMember Cmdlet
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "Get-LocalGroupMember ") AND ((src.process.cmdline containsCIS "domain admins" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS " administrator" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS " administrateur" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "enterprise admins" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "Exchange Trusted Subsystem" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "Remote Desktop Users" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "Utilisateurs du Bureau à distance" OR src.process.cmdline containsCIS "Usuarios de escritorio remoto")))
